{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c531","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c836-a2d8-7092-9401-37d2858a2ec3"},"sequence":243,"recorded_at":1780531400000481,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a68a1bdc-1b82-44d2-b715-51014e29fd57","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"a68a1bdc-1b82-44d2-b715-51014e29fd57","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a68a1bdc-1b82-44d2-b715-51014e29fd57"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c837-5460-7ee3-9943-b1a6845b792f"},"task_id":"01a0c837-5460-7ee3-9943-b1a6845b792f","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c837-5460-7ee3-9943-b1a6845b792f","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-8-1\",\n  \"command\": \"task-board q 'get(TASK-260830-1c28dz){id title status checklist outcomeResources}' 2>&1 | python3 -c \\\"import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(json.dumps(d,indent=1)[:8000])\\\"\",\n  \"description\": \"Query task checklist and outcomes\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"{\\n \\\"checklist\\\": [\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"Production entry points implement the scoped deliverable: Implement create, attach, status, quiesce, safe-boundary, stop, stale termination, and restore via structured commands\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": false\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"Relevant positive, negative, compatibility, and recovery tests pass with logs attached\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": false\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"README/doctor/capability evidence and specification traceability are updated without unsupported claims\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": false\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"A gate x entry census is committed as a table in the conformance matrix and mirrored in TRACEABILITY: every production entry that reaches each gate gets a named test plus an admitting narrowing row, or unreachable with a reason, or a stated bound with an owner; every gate implemented on two or more sides carries a row-count symmetry line\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": false\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"The eight named operations (create, attach, status, quiesce, safe-boundary, stop, stale termination, restore) are each driven through a production entry by a named committed test, with the n-of-8 ratio and the call site stated per operation\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": true\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"The exec and probe adapters that TASK-260830-35urbp declared as this leaf bound (its Dependencies had no production implementation) exist and are driven, and the server socket gets crash and idempotency evidence or an explicit purity bound\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": true\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"The bounds 35urbp handed over are each dispositioned: B18 sun_path 104-byte limit on the derived socket path, B16 nested invocation from inside an AX pane (ambient collision, decide deliberately), B19/B20 SPEC 810-812 before-bind rejection of an unsafe root at the bind step, and the rev7 P3-A fresh-decoy foreground attach wiring if attach semantics land here rather than in g0pcnt\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": true\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"Composing packages keep working, proven by an OUTCOME-keyed comparison over the complete importer set (not a name-keyed per-test diff of one package), with every input that moved across an admission or refusal arm named in the results\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": false\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"Every rule is driven to its effect by a committed test that passes with NO tmux process anywhere; any real-tmux test is separately gated and is never the only witness for an acceptance row, and the results state which rows have a real-tmux witness in addition to their deterministic one\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": false\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"Code written per task description and AC\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": false\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"Relevant tests written for new or changed behavior and passing\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": false\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"In a managed Story worktree the candidate is left UNCOMMITTED in the worktree for the handoff to snapshot \\\\u2014 never commit on the Story branch. A producer commit moves the branch tip off the recorded checkpoint and the handoff refuses with change_request_candidate_committed_past_checkpoint; repair with `git reset --soft <checkpoint_oid>` before completing again.\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": true\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"Every command, message, state, or refusal named in the AC is driven through the production entry point by a named committed test, or is declared a stated bound. Report coverage as a ratio \\\\u2014 `n of m AC rows driven` \\\\u2014 and name the production call site for each. Prose in place of the ratio is not evidence.\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": false\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"Gating, refusing, validating, authorizing, or attesting behavior covered by negative tests that fail when the gate admits what it must reject, with the production call site named\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": false\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"Every gate ships at least one NARROWING mutant \\\\u2014 the gate stays present and is weakened to admit exactly one member of the class it must reject, and a named test must fail. A delete-only mutant proves only that the gate exists and is not accepted as evidence.\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": false\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"A gate that inspects source text is additionally attacked by a mutant that PRESERVES the searched-for token and changes behavior, and the mutant harness executes the behavioral suite, not only the static checker.\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": true\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"Lint clean\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": true\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"Relevant build/validation commands run after changes and build not broken\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": true\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"New outcome artifact attached on the board with a task-scoped name when the work produces notes, logs, screenshots, or other deliverables\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": true\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"Important findings, decisions, anomalies, or regressions recorded in logbook when relevant\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": true\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"Implementation matches AC\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": false\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"Solution fits project architecture\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": true\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"Tests green\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": false\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"Gate, refusal, validation, authorization, and attestation behavior attacked, not read \\\\u2014 positive-path-only evidence is not accepted\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": true\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"text\\\": \\\"If review does not accept the work \\\\u2014 verdict evidence added and status routed by the explicit verdict branches\\\",\\n   \\\"done\\\": true\\n  }\\n ],\\n \\\"id\\\": \\\"TASK-260830-1c28dz\\\",\\n \\\"outcomeResources\\\": [\\n  {\\n   \\\"name\\\": \\\"TASK-260830-1c28dz_spawn-log_-implementer--developer--muse-_RUN-260921-c03ff8.log\\\",\\n   \\\"uri\\\": \\\"file://TASK-260830-1c28dz/TASK-260830-1c28dz_spawn-log_-implementer--developer--muse-_RUN-260921-c03ff8.log\\\",\\n   \\\"description\\\": \\\"System spawn log captured by task-board\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"name\\\": \\\"TASK-260830-1c28dz_producer-evidence.tar.gz\\\",\\n   \\\"uri\\\": \\\"file://TASK-260830-1c28dz/TASK-260830-1c28dz_producer-evidence.tar.gz\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"name\\\": \\\"TASK-260830-1c28dz_conformance-matrix.md\\\",\\n   \\\"uri\\\": \\\"file://TASK-260830-1c28dz/TASK-260830-1c28dz_conformance-matrix.md\\\",\\n   \\\"description\\\": \\\"rev4 conformance matrix\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"name\\\": \\\"TASK-260830-1c28dz_change-request_rev1.patch\\\",\\n   \\\"uri\\\": \\\"file://TASK-260830-1c28dz/TASK-260830-1c28dz_change-request_rev1.patch\\\",\\n   \\\"description\\\": \\\"Change Request CR-TASK-260830-1c28dz-1 revision 1 candidate patch (repository_delta=present, 33 changed paths)\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"name\\\": \\\"TASK-260830-1c28dz_change-request_rev1-validation.log\\\",\\n   \\\"uri\\\": \\\"file://TASK-260830-1c28dz/TASK-260830-1c28dz_change-request_rev1-validation.log\\\",\\n   \\\"description\\\": \\\"Change Request CR-TASK-260830-1c28dz-1 revision 1 bounded validation log\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"name\\\": \\\"TASK-260830-1c28dz_spawn-log_-reviewer--reviewer--codex-_RUN-260922-3770c1.log\\\",\\n   \\\"uri\\\": \\\"file://TASK-260830-1c28dz/TASK-260830-1c28dz_spawn-log_-reviewer--reviewer--codex-_RUN-260922-3770c1.log\\\",\\n   \\\"description\\\": \\\"System spawn log captured by task-board\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"name\\\": \\\"TASK-260830-1c28dz_review-verdict-rev1.md\\\",\\n   \\\"uri\\\": \\\"file://TASK-260830-1c28dz/TASK-260830-1c28dz_review-verdict-rev1.md\\\",\\n   \\\"description\\\": \\\"Changes requested: independent CR1 review with production regressions and rework scope\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"name\\\": \\\"TASK-260830-1c28dz_review-evidence-rev1.tar.gz\\\",\\n   \\\"uri\\\": \\\"file://TASK-260830-1c28dz/TASK-260830-1c28dz_review-evidence-rev1.tar.gz\\\",\\n   \\\"description\\\": \\\"Independent CR1 raw test logs, two mutation passes, adversarial probes and byte audit\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"name\\\": \\\"TASK-260830-1c28dz_spawn-log_-implementer--developer--muse-_RUN-260922-6d8a5c.log\\\",\\n   \\\"uri\\\": \\\"file://TASK-260830-1c28dz/TASK-260830-1c28dz_spawn-log_-implementer--developer--muse-_RUN-260922-6d8a5c.log\\\",\\n   \\\"description\\\": \\\"System spawn log captured by task-board\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"name\\\": \\\"TASK-260830-1c28dz_results.md\\\",\\n   \\\"uri\\\": \\\"file://TASK-260830-1c28dz/TASK-260830-1c28dz_results.md\\\",\\n   \\\"description\\\": \\\"rev4 producer results\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n   \\\"name\\\": \\\"TASK-260830-1c28dz_rework-evidence-rev2.tar.gz\\\",\\n   \\\"uri\\\": \\\"file://TA