{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c977","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c836-a2d8-7092-9401-37d2858a2ec3"},"sequence":790,"recorded_at":1780531400001575,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a68a1bdc-1b82-44d2-b715-51014e29fd57","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"a68a1bdc-1b82-44d2-b715-51014e29fd57","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a68a1bdc-1b82-44d2-b715-51014e29fd57"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c838-8764-7d80-bde5-127f5adf21dd"},"task_id":"01a0c838-8764-7d80-bde5-127f5adf21dd","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c838-8764-7d80-bde5-127f5adf21dd","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-18-1\",\n  \"command\": \"grep -n \\\"func.*Descriptor\\\" internal/axpane/descriptor.go | head -n 20; echo ===; grep -n \\\"terminal_instance_id\\\" internal/axpane/*.go | grep -v test | head -n 20; echo \\\"===BackendFacts===\\\"; grep -n \\\"type BackendFacts\\\" -A 40 internal/axpane/*.go | head -n 60; echo \\\"===Realm===\\\"; grep -n \\\"type Realm struct\\\" -A 30 internal/axpane/*.go | head -n 40; echo \\\"===InstanceBinding===\\\"; grep -n \\\"type InstanceBinding\\\" -A 30 internal/terminalbackend/*.go | head -n 40\",\n  \"description\": \"Find descriptor admission and related structs\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"88:func BuildDescriptor(params DescriptorParams) ([]byte, error) {\\n===\\ninternal/axpane/binding.go:36:\\tTerminalInstanceID string `json:\\\"terminal_instance_id\\\"`\\ninternal/axpane/binding.go:48:\\t\\\"terminal_instance_id\\\",\\ninternal/axpane/binding.go:617:\\t\\t\\\"terminal_instance_id\\\":   stored.TerminalInstanceID,\\ninternal/axpane/binding.go:637:\\t\\tTerminalInstanceID string `json:\\\"terminal_instance_id\\\"`\\ninternal/axpane/descriptor.go:105:\\t\\t\\\"terminal_instance_id\\\":   instance,\\n===BackendFacts===\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go:172:type BackendFacts struct {\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-173-\\t// Manifest, Probe, and Evidence are the raw documents parsed by\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-174-\\t// the terminalbackend owner.\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-175-\\tManifest []byte\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-176-\\tProbe    []byte\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-177-\\tEvidence [][]byte\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-178-\\t// RawGeneration is the AX-known raw generation the admission\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-179-\\t// binds to; Verify checks evidence signatures.\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-180-\\tRawGeneration string\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-181-\\tVerify        terminalbackend.SignatureVerifier\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-182-\\t// Now is the admission instant for evidence liveness.\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-183-\\tNow time.Time\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-184-}\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-185-\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-186-// Input is the complete Decide surface: validated configuration,\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-187-// the loaded session, the local lease view, materialization and\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-188-// checkpoint state, the profile chain, provider identity, backend\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-189-// identity, realm readiness, and the bootstrap binding. I/O-free\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-190-// callers build it by hand; Run builds it through the gates.go\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-191-// adapters over the durable stores.\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-192-type Input struct {\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-193-\\t// SessionID is the logical session under decision.\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-194-\\tSessionID string\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-195-\\t// BootstrapOperationID is the caller-stable bootstrap operation.\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-196-\\tBootstrapOperationID string\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-197-\\t// Mode selects the fencing entry and capability row.\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-198-\\tMode Mode\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-199-\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-200-\\t// ConfigErr is the ValidateConfig outcome; non-nil refuses\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-201-\\t// invalid_config.\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-202-\\tConfigErr error\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-203-\\t// SessionKnown reports that the logical session loaded; false\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-204-\\t// refuses invalid_arguments.\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-205-\\tSessionKnown bool\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-206-\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-207-\\t// ExistingBinding is the proven bootstrap receipt for THIS\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-208-\\t// (session_id, bootstrap_operation_id) pair, or nil when the\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-209-\\t// pair is unrecorded. A recorded pair reattaches; an\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-210-\\t// unrecorded pair on a bound session inside the bootstrap\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-211-\\t// window refuses idempotency_mismatch; an unrecorded pair\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-212-\\t// after the window closed installs a new receipt and\\n===Realm===\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go:105:type Realm struct {\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-106-\\t// Caller is CallerForeground or CallerBackground.\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-107-\\tCaller string\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-108-\\t// BrokerState, ServerGeneration, and Remediation are the typed\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-109-\\t// realm/readiness details the capability_unavailable refusal\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-110-\\t// carries. They are required: an empty member refuses\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-111-\\t// invalid_arguments instead of emitting an untyped refusal.\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-112-\\t// ServerGeneration must equal the current AX-known raw\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-113-\\t// generation the backend admission binds to; a stale generation\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-114-\\t// refuses capability_unavailable, never launches.\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-115-\\tBrokerState      string\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-116-\\tServerGeneration string\\ninternal/axpane/decide.go-117-\\tRemediation      string\\ninternal/axp