th: the reopened attach refuses through the attach dispatch.\",\n+    ),\n+    Mutant(\n+        name=\"N-attach-health-check\",\n+        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/ops.go\",\n+        find='\\tif _, _, err := lc.States.Lookup(instanceID); err != nil {\\n\\t\\treturn err\\n\\t}\\n',\n+        replace='\\tif _, _, err := lc.States.Lookup(instanceID); err != nil && instanceID != \"0198f4c8-8e50-7f66-8f70-222222222221\" {\\n\\t\\treturn err\\n\\t}\\n',\n+        count=1,\n+        run=\"TestExecuteAttachErrorsOnStateReadFailure\",\n+        expect=\"KILLED\",\n+        note=\"Admits exactly the fixture instance past the attach health check (its unreadable record is ignored); every other instance still fails closed. Kill path: the attach succeeds over the unreadable state through the attach dispatch.\",\n+    ),\n+    Mutant(\n+        name=\"N-failure-preserves-record\",\n+        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/lifecycle.go\",\n+        find='\\t_, found, err := lc.States.Lookup(instance)\\n\\tif err != nil || found {\\n\\t\\treturn\\n\\t}\\n',\n+        replace='\\t_, found, err := lc.States.Lookup(instance)\\n\\tif err != nil || (found && instance != \"0198f4c8-8e50-7f66-8f70-222222222221\") {\\n\\t\\treturn\\n\\t}\\n',\n+        count=1,\n+        run=\"TestReviewFailedStopCannotEraseQuiescence\",\n+        expect=\"KILLED\",\n+        note=\"Admits exactly the fixture instance past the never-overwrite arm (its failure result overwrites the barrier memory); every other instance keeps its record. Kill path: the memory assertion fails (admission still refuses via the proof, which is the construction).\",\n+    ),\n+    Mutant(\n+        name=\"N-create-incarnation-record\",\n+        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/lifecycle.go\",\n+        find='\\t\\tif err := lc.States.RecordIncarnation(body.Context.TerminalInstanceID, body.Context.IdempotencyKey); err != nil {\\n\\t\\t\\treturn outcome, &Error{Code: terminalbackend.CodeIntegrityFailure, Detail: \"create incarnation image\"}\\n',\n+        replace='