{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000dd81","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c836-a2d8-7092-9401-37d2858a2ec3"},"sequence":3355,"recorded_at":1780531400006705,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a68a1bdc-1b82-44d2-b715-51014e29fd57","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"a68a1bdc-1b82-44d2-b715-51014e29fd57","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a68a1bdc-1b82-44d2-b715-51014e29fd57"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c84f-34e7-77e2-9b06-f9e0f53573c4"},"task_id":"01a0c84f-34e7-77e2-9b06-f9e0f53573c4","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c84f-34e7-77e2-9b06-f9e0f53573c4","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: line 193\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-| 79 | Attach returns the caller-executed vector with its descriptor and never execs an interactive attach: closed-shape admission, deadline, matching-transport capability, the quiescing input barrier, live attestation, and the durable client receipt, with identical requests replaying; read-only authorization emits the read-only vector, a read-only attach observes without reopening quiesced input, and a lost barrier write fails closed with the barrier recovering from the completed closure outcomes (a corrupt scan or empty time errors). | executeAttach | TestExecuteAttach, TestExecuteAttachRefusals, TestExecuteAttachIdempotent, TestAttachDescriptorNeverPersisted, TestExecuteAttachRefusesMeshWithoutCapability, TestExecuteAttachRefusesDeadline, TestExecuteAttachRefusesInputWhenQuiescing, TestExecuteReadOnlyAttachIsReadOnly, TestExecuteReadOnlyAttachPreservesQuiescedInput, TestExecuteQuiesceStateWriteFailureRefusesWiredAttach, TestExecuteAttachErrorsOnCorruptBarrierScan, TestExecuteAttachErrorsOnEmptyBarrierTime |\n+| 79 | Attach returns the caller-executed vector with its descriptor and never execs an interactive attach: closed-shape admission, deadline, matching-transport capability, the quiescing input barrier, live attestation, and the durable client receipt, with identical requests replaying; read-only authorization emits the read-only vector, a read-only attach observes without reopening quiesced input, and a lost barrier write fails closed. The barrier verdict is the incarnation-scoped closure proof alone: stale memory, caller-carried source state, and failure results are never consulted for their value, so none of them can reopen a closed input; only a fresh create or restore reopens, by rotating the incarnation. A corrupt scan, an empty time, a keyless report, or an unreadable state record errors. | executeAttach | TestExecuteAttach, TestExecuteAttachRefusals, TestExecuteAttachIdempotent, TestAttachDescriptorNeverPersisted, TestExecuteAttachRefusesMeshWithoutCapability, TestExecuteAttachRefusesDeadline, TestExecuteAttachRefusesInputWhenQuiescing, TestExecuteReadOnlyAttachIsReadOnly, TestExecuteReadOnlyAttachPreservesQuiescedInput, TestExecuteQuiesceStateWriteFailureRefusesWiredAttach, TestExecuteAttachErrorsOnCorruptBarrierScan, TestExecuteAttachErrorsOnEmptyBarrierTime, TestReviewExistingActiveMemoryCannotReopenQuiescedInput, TestReviewFailedStopCannotEraseQuiescence, TestExecuteFailedStopPreservesQuiescingMemory, TestExecuteAdvisoryMemoryNeverDecidesAdmission, TestExecuteAttachErrorsOnEmptyBarrierKey, TestExecuteAttachErrorsOnStateReadFailure |\n","final_result":true}}}
