{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e1a3","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c836-a2d8-7092-9401-37d2858a2ec3"},"sequence":3884,"recorded_at":1780531400007763,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a68a1bdc-1b82-44d2-b715-51014e29fd57","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"a68a1bdc-1b82-44d2-b715-51014e29fd57","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a68a1bdc-1b82-44d2-b715-51014e29fd57"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c851-17f5-70f1-aec6-ccd81e8c5cca"},"task_id":"01a0c851-17f5-70f1-aec6-ccd81e8c5cca","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c851-17f5-70f1-aec6-ccd81e8c5cca","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 627-639\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-The refresh runs before the decision on every row (N-wrapper-\n-reorder-refresh admits exactly the fixture session past the\n-refresh-success arm into stale local knowledge and is killed by\n-the offer/resume/park tests together), so the offer path never\n-presents the lapsed grant to backend restore authorization. The\n-resume rows execute only bound to the decided winner\n-(N-wrapper-winner-lease, N-wrapper-winner-epoch); late answers\n-never verify whether they arrive after the deadline\n-(N-wrapper-refresh-expired) or the adapter ignores cancellation\n-(N-wrapper-refresh-deadline). No production mesh transport backs\n-the adapter (B37). Union-rival ambiguity is unmodeled (B38). The parked wire result\n-of the backend restore entry itself (RestoredParked) stays a\n-backend-row concern, not a Table E row.\n+The refresh runs before the decision on every row (N-wrapper-\n+reorder-refresh admits exactly the fixture session past the\n+refresh-success arm into stale local knowledge and is killed by\n+the offer/resume/park tests together), so the offer path never\n+presents the lapsed grant to backend restore authorization. The\n+resume rows execute only bound to the decided session, bootstrap,\n+instance, backend, generation, and winner as one composed\n+authorization (N-wrapper-restore-session, N-wrapper-restore-\n+bootstrap, N-wrapper-restore-instance, N-wrapper-restore-backend,\n+N-wrapper-restore-generation, N-wrapper-winner-lease,\n+N-wrapper-winner-epoch); late answers never verify whether they\n+arrive after the deadline (N-wrapper-refresh-expired) or the\n+adapter ignores cancellation (N-wrapper-refresh-deadline). No\n+production mesh transport backs the adapter (B37). Union-rival\n+ambiguity is unmodeled (B38). The parked wire result\n+of the backend restore entry itself (RestoredParked) stays a\n+backend-row concern, not a Table E row.\n","final_result":true}}}
