{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e22f","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c836-a2d8-7092-9401-37d2858a2ec3"},"sequence":3954,"recorded_at":1780531400007903,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a68a1bdc-1b82-44d2-b715-51014e29fd57","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"a68a1bdc-1b82-44d2-b715-51014e29fd57","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a68a1bdc-1b82-44d2-b715-51014e29fd57"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c851-5858-71a0-8f51-60f04d512c11"},"task_id":"01a0c851-5858-71a0-8f51-60f04d512c11","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c851-5858-71a0-8f51-60f04d512c11","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 920-924\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-reachable-undriven reclass. Revision 4 fills B37 (no production\n-mesh refresh transport; the composition enforces the bound on any\n-injected adapter), extends Table E with the binding, expiry, race,\n-and enforcement outcomes, and moves the SPW rootwrite cell from\n-B39 to measured.\n+reachable-undriven reclass. Revision 4 fills B37 (no production\n+mesh refresh transport; the composition enforces the bound on any\n+injected adapter), extends Table E with the binding, expiry, race,\n+and enforcement outcomes, and moves the SPW rootwrite cell from\n+B39 to measured. Revision 5 makes the incarnation-scoped closure\n+proof the sole barrier verdict (new Table D rows\n+barrierincarnation, barrierkey, attachhealth, failurerecord,\n+createincarnation, restoreincarnation, incarnationrecord,\n+incarnationlookup), extends Table E with the five composed-binding\n+refusals, moves the PRB rootwrite cell from B39 to measured, and\n+states B40 (stuck rotation) and B41 (structural replay skip).\n","final_result":true}}}
