{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000f209","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c836-a2d8-7092-9401-37d2858a2ec3"},"sequence":5983,"recorded_at":1780531400011961,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a68a1bdc-1b82-44d2-b715-51014e29fd57","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"a68a1bdc-1b82-44d2-b715-51014e29fd57","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a68a1bdc-1b82-44d2-b715-51014e29fd57"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c867-dd71-7950-8ef2-aa7df777a795"},"task_id":"01a0c867-dd71-7950-8ef2-aa7df777a795","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c867-dd71-7950-8ef2-aa7df777a795","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-159-1\",\n  \"command\": \"sed -n 2395,2430p README.md\",\n  \"description\": \"Read README lifecycle section\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"Reconcile/ResolveEvidence admission consumed as an `Admitted` set\\ncomposed only with generation equality: a missing realm row or a\\nstale-generation admission refuses, so a cached observation replayed as\\nlive authorizes nothing. Every broker, server, and spawner interaction\\nruns through injected dependencies, so the suite passes with no tmux\\nprocess anywhere; native Windows refuses every request. Lifecycle\\noperations — create, attach, status, quiesce, safe-boundary, stop,\\nstale termination, restore — run through structured argv builders over\\nthe dedicated socket: `Execute` admits exactly the eight operations\\nand refuses unknown ones, the exec adapter reconstructs the exact\\n`tmux -S <socket> <subcommand>` vector per operation and refuses\\nforged binaries, flag injection, and ambient socket discovery, and\\nthe probed socket generation is bound (B18-B20) before any execution.\\nBodies are pure argv builders whose stable pane entrypoint stays\\n`ax pane SESSION_ID`; effects run through the landed terminstance\\nengine with strict per-operation deadlines, generation rechecks, and\\nAX-side state memory for reconciliation, while attach, terminate, and\\nrestore mirror the landed backend, fencing, and axpane gates. Quiesce\\ncuts operator input by locking then detaching every attached client\\nand refusing new input-authorized attaches at the entry (read-only\\nobservation stays); the boundary waits blocking for the wrapper\\nsignal with the proof kind bound into its evidence; probes prove\\nabsence only from marked tmux stderr and read every other failure as\\nunknown. Every mutating operation replays the identical request\\nidempotently; uncertain receipts reconcile through status before\\nresuming.\\n\\nRun the focused tests and coverage with:\\n\\n```bash\\ngo test ./internal/tmuxserver -count=1\\ngo test ./internal/tmuxserver -cover -count=1\\n```\\n\\nRun the narrowing battery (248 narrowing mutants, two supplementary\\nadditive rows, plus one harmless control) with:\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1956,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 489,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
