nd axpane gates. Quiesce\\ncuts operator input by locking then detaching every attached client\\nand refusing new input-authorized attaches at the entry (read-only\\nobservation stays); the boundary waits blocking for the wrapper\\nsignal with the proof kind bound into its evidence; probes prove\\nabsence only from marked tmux stderr and read every other failure as\\nunknown. Every mutating operation replays the identical request\\nidempotently; uncertain receipts reconcile through status before\\nresuming.\\n\\nRun the focused tests and coverage with:\\n\\n```bash\\ngo test ./internal/tmuxserver -count=1\\ngo test ./internal/tmuxserver -cover -count=1\\n```\\n\\nRun the narrowing battery (248 narrowing mutants, two supplementary\\nadditive rows, plus one harmless control) with:\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1956,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 489,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
